layout_mode = 2
size_flags_horizontal = 3
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "Version 0.1
-Added player movement
-Added enemies
-Added moving platforms
-Added death and respawning
-Added death sound
-Added main menu

Main Menu
-Added a new title screen
-Added a Start Game btton
-Added a Version Notes button
-Added a Credits button

Version Notes
-Version notes now display the newest updates first.
-Added a Back button for returning to menu.

Credits
-Added a credits screen.
-Added vertically scrolling movie-style credits.
-Added a fixed Back button that remains available.

Version 0.2

Gameplay
-Added Dash mechanic
-Added Afterimage2D to create an afterimage effect on the dash
-Added Dash effects
-Changed slime enemies from Node2D to CharacterBody, added gravity, and added wall and platform-edge detection with raycasts
-Fixed tile collisions so slimes could move

Audio
-Basic movement sounds, jump dash, landing, death, revive
-Updated buses

Death
-Added Saltmire FX, a shader that creates a dissolve and appear effect

Version 0.3

New
-Added new player animations for idle, running, jumping, and dashing
-Added a level-completion screen that displays the number of coins collected
-Added Replay and Main Menu buttons to the completetion screen
-Added randomized footstep sounds

Improvements
-Adjusted level difficulty to be more gradual challenge
-Improved enemy placement and platforming
-Improved death and respawn effects
-Updated moving platforms and animations
-Improved UI layout

Bug Fix
-Coin tracking issues
-Player animation issues
-Adjust animation timing and sound synchronization







